  THE CREATURE QUIETS AS IT TRAINS. Delivery falls 0.716 -> 0.261 across
  the session, -0.4554 +- 0.0230 (19.8 SE), 12 of 12 creatures down. So a
  longer session has a lower MEAN delivered fraction by running further
  down one decaying curve, which is reading (a): `dirbudget`'s rungs are
  nested prefixes of this trajectory and its decline has a candidate
  about PRODUCTION rather than assignment capacity. That candidate is the
  same suspect as the drone, the voicing gate and the resonant jaw.
    WHAT THIS DOES NOT ESTABLISH: that the rotation's decline IS the
    delivery decline. Delivery falling and direction falling on the same
    axis is a shared correlate, and the ladder's own `d trials` predictor
    (r = +0.721) is consistent with either. Separating them needs a rung
    matched on DELIVERED trials rather than on ticks.
